<title>USA: CheckFree completes software business sale.</title>
<headline>CheckFree completes software business sale.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>CheckFree Corp said on Friday that it has completed the sale of its securities certificate accounting software business to a SunGard Data Systems Inc unit for $20 million.</p>
<p>It said the sale included the existing installed base of CSSII products and all maintenance contracts. In addition, SunGard will assume the service and support responsibilities for the products.</p>
<p>CheckFree announced its plan to divest the CSSII business on July 23, and the agreement to sell the unit to SunGard on August 21.</p>
</text>
